  "Michelada": { label: "Beer Cocktail", ingredients: ["12 oz light Mexican lager (e.g. Dos Equis, Corona)", "2 oz Clamato or tomato juice", "1 oz fresh lime juice", "2 dashes hot sauce (e.g. Tabasco or Valentina)", "2 dashes Worcestershire sauce", "Tajín or salt rim", "Ice"], instructions: "Rim a pint glass with Tajín or salt. Fill with ice. Add lime juice, Clamato, hot sauce, and Worcestershire. Top with lager and stir gently. Garnish with a lime wedge." },
